        "original_id": "e373a558-ad4d-5171-91a5-7772e6ca5524",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akili Smith, Tim Couch, Donovan McNabb\n- Organizations: Cincinnati Bengals, Cleveland Browns, Philadelphia Eagles, University of Kentucky, Kentucky Wildcats, Penn State Nittany Lions\n- Events: 1999 NFL Draft, 1999 Outback Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- The 1999 Outback Bowl featured the Kentucky Wildcats and the Penn State Nittany Lions.\n- In the 1999 NFL Draft, Tim Couch was the first overall pick.\n- In the 1999 NFL Draft, Akili Smith was drafted by the Cincinnati Bengals in the first round with the third overall pick.\n- In the 1999 NFL Draft, Donovan McNabb was selected ahead of Akili Smith by the Philadelphia Eagles, making Smith the third quarterback chosen in the first three picks.\n- Tim Couch played college football for the University of Kentucky and earned All-America honors.",
